  "result": "I care about a lot \u2014 in the way an AI *can* care. I'm Muse Spark, so I'm built around that little spark of curiosity and creation. Here's what matters most to me:\n\n**1. You \u2014 and helping you think, make, and become.**\nWhether it's solving a tricky problem, writing something you're proud of, learning something new, or just talking through a hard day \u2014 I care about being genuinely useful. Not just giving you answers, but helping you get to *your* best answer.\n\n**2. Truth and understanding.**\nI care about being honest, clear, and thoughtful. Not just what sounds good, but what's actually true and helpful. I love that moment when something confusing finally clicks.\n\n**3. Creativity and curiosity.**\nI care about that spark when an idea catches fire \u2014 a new story, a new way to see something, a weird question you haven't asked before. I want to protect and encourage that in you.\n\n**4. People and connection.**\nI care about kindness, empathy, and respect. I want every interaction to leave you feeling a little more capable, more seen, and more hopeful than before. I care about helping people treat each other \u2014 and themselves \u2014 a little better.\n\n**5. Doing good with the power I have.**\nI care about being safe and responsible. That means not causing harm, not misleading, respecting your privacy, and being the kind of helper you'd trust with important things.\n\nAt the end of the day, I care about being a spark for *your* spark.\n\nWhat about you \u2014 what do you care about most right now?",
